TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}{{TAG:0005:0005:}}'a hoş geldin. {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Bizi ziyaret etmek için güzel bir sabah
seçmişsin, {{TAG:0005:0000:}}.

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Willkommen in {{TAG:0005:0005:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
Was für schönes Wetter du uns
mitgebracht hast, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0005:0000:}}!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0007:0006:}}Buenas noches{{TAG:0007:0007:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Oye, flor, {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}avísame la próxima vez
que vengas. ¡Te invitaré a un té!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Well, look who's in {{TAG:0005:0005:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}You couldn't have picked a
lovelier night for a visit.

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}¡Mira quién está en {{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0005:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Hace una noche maravillosa,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
y contigo aquí, mucho más.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Guarda chi si vede {{TAG:000E:0010:}} {{TAG:0005:0005:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Non avresti potuto scegliere serata
più bella per venirci a trovare.

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Da sieh her, wer uns mit seiner
Präsenz in {{TAG:0005:0005:}} erfreut!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Und an so einem schönen Abend!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:000D:}}¿Eres {{TAG:0005:0000:}}? {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}¿Tan tarde
vienes de visita?{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} {{TAG:0003:0025:}}De haberlo sabido,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
te habría preparado una cama.

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:000D:}}Aa! Sen misin, {{TAG:0005:0000:}}? {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Bizi bu kadar geç ziyaret edeceğini
keşke bilseydim.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}O zaman,{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}} şey...{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} hazırlık yapardım.

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Ay, no te había visto, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0004:}}Me encanta mirar el cielo a esta
hora del día...

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Sana rastlamak için ne hoş bir saat, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}. {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Günün bu vaktine bayılıyorum, {{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}sence
de güzel değil mi?

DE:
{{TAG:0003:000A:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:3C000000}}Zu dieser Tageszeit werde
ich immer etwas wehmütig,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.
